# GOLF-35 Phase A2 — keep every deployment link-only (not search-indexed)
# while the app is pre-launch. Cloudflare Pages headers format: a path
# pattern followed by indented header lines.
#
# Intentionally blanket (applies to both production and preview) since
# both are link-only right now. Once the site is ready to be publicly
# discoverable, this needs to become per-environment (Pages headers has
# no built-in env condition — the usual approach is a tiny addition to
# functions/_middleware.js that sets this header only when a "prod but
# still private" flag isn't set, or simply deleting this file once launch
# is public).
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
